       7060-SEL-DIV-INV-010.

      ** A6Z01-SEL DIV INV MODULE
      ** COMMENTS:
      ******************************************************************
      ***
      *** THIS MODULE WILL DETERMINE THE PRICING LEVEL FOR A DIVISION
      *** INVENTORY ITEM PRODUCT. IF THE VENDOR PRODUCT IS IN THE DIV
      *** INVENTORY, THE PRICE LEVEL FROM THE RETRIEVED ROW WILL BE USED
      *** IN OBTAINING THE PRODUCT PRICE FROM THE VENDOR PRICE LIST. IF
      *** A DIV INVENTORY ITEM ROW IS NOT RETRIEVED, THE MAXIMUM PRICE
      *** LEVEL IN THE VENDOR PRICE LIST WILL BE USED.
      *** THE FOLLOWING INPUT FIELDS ARE REQUIRED:
      ***       ING01-I-VENDOR, VNG03-I-VENDOR
      ***       ING01-I-VND-PRODUCT, VNG03-I-VND-PRODUCT
      ***       ING01-I-DIVISION,
      ***       VNG03-I-DIVISION, VNG03-D-VND-PRC-LIST-EFF
      ***       VNG03-D-PRC-EXPIRE
      ***
      ******************************************************************
      ***
      ** SELECT DIV INVENTORY ITEM (ING01) **

           PERFORM 9195-SQL-SELECT-010  THRU
                   9195-EXIT.

           EVALUATE SQLCODE
               WHEN +0
                   MOVE ING01-C-INV-CLASS
                                       TO OMGPR-C-INV-CLASS
                   MOVE ING01-C-DIV-INV-PRC-LVL
                                       TO VNG03-C-VND-PRC-LEVEL
                   PERFORM 7105-SEL-PRC-LST-010  THRU
                           7105-EXIT
               WHEN +100
                   MOVE WS-NO-IND      TO ING01-F-STOCK-ITEM
                   PERFORM 7575-SEL-MAX-PRCLST-010  THRU
                           7575-EXIT
      ** 2/13/96 - SRC - MADE CHANGES TO IMPROVE EFFICIENCY
      **PERFORM A6Z01-SEL MAX PRC LST OLD
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 'SELECT'       TO WS-DB-OPERATION
                   MOVE 'ING01'        TO WS-DB-NAME
                   MOVE SQLCODE        TO WS-DB-RETURN-CODE
                   MOVE 'DB ERROR'     TO WS-DB-STATUS-MSG
                   MOVE 23             TO WS-DB-ERROR-NBR
                                          OMGPR-Q-ERROR-NBR
                   MOVE WS-DB2-FATAL-ERROR-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-Q-ERROR-CODE
                   MOVE WS-DB-OPERATION-MSG
                                       TO OMGPR-ERROR-MESSAGE
                   MOVE WS-YES-IND     TO OMGPR-F-PRICER-ERROR
                   GO TO 0020-EXIT-PRICER
           END-EVALUATE.


      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** DETERMINE IF AN ITEM IS AN STOCKED ITEM OR NOT
      **  1. NO  - THERE IS NO INVENTORY ITEM RECORD (ING01)
      **  2. NO  - THERE IS AN INVENTORY ITEM RECORD AND
      **           THE ING01-F-STOCK-ITEM = 'N'
      **  3. YES - THERE IS AN INVENTORY ITEM RECORD AND
      **           THE ING01-F-STOCK-ITEM = 'Y'

           MOVE ING01-F-STOCK-ITEM     TO OMGPR-F-STOCK-ITEM.

