           IF VNG03-D-VND-PRC-EXPIRE-NI  NOT =  -1
TA1112*        ADD 1                   TO WS-Q-CHECK
               MOVE VNG03-D-VND-PRC-EXPIRE
TA1112*                                TO WS-D-CHECK (WS-Q-CHECK)
TA1112                                 TO WS-PRICE-EXP-DATE
TA1112         PERFORM 7695-ADD-EXP-DATE-ARRA-010
TA1112            THRU 7695-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * END OF: A6Z01-SEL DIV INV MODULE

