       7070-PRO-REBT-AMTS-010.

      ** A6Z01-PRO REBT AMTS MODULE
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** NOTE: ACQ, DEALER, AND CONT COST ARE IN THE ORDER U/M **
      **       UNLESS HAVE TO GET THE 01 LEVEL IN THIS PROCESS **

           IF WS-COST-CONT-FND
               MOVE ZEROES             TO WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ
      ** DETERMINE WHETHER TO REBATE TO ACQ COST(NET COST) OR DEALER
      *COST **
      ** SRC 9/17/96 - ALWAYS USE DEALER COST - PER USER REQUEST FOR NEW
      **               REBATE CALCULATION.
      ** USE DEALER COST **
               IF OMGPR-F-VEND-BST-CST-RBT  =  'Y'
      ** LEVEL 01 **
                   IF OMGPR-C-VND-PRC-LEVEL  =  '01'
                       MOVE OMGPR-A-VND-PRC-DEALER
                                       TO WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ
                   ELSE
                       MOVE '01'       TO VNG03-C-VND-PRC-LEVEL
                       PERFORM 7105-SEL-PRC-LST-010  THRU
                               7105-EXIT
                       PERFORM 7110-CVT-PRC-LST-UM-010  THRU
                               7110-EXIT
                       COMPUTE WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ ROUNDED =
                               ((VNG03-A-VND-PRC-DEALER *
                                 WS-CA-CONVERT-UP-UMF) /
                                WS-CA-CONVERT-DOWN-UMF)
                   END-IF
               END-IF

               IF OMGPR-F-VEND-BST-CST-RBT  =  'N'
      ** DIVISION LEVEL **
                   MOVE OMGPR-A-VND-PRC-DEALER
                                       TO WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ
               END-IF
      ** SAVE THE COST THAT WAS USED TO CALCULATE REBATES. **
               MOVE WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ TO OMGPR-A-REBATE-COST
      ** CALCULATE THE CONTRACT REBATE AMOUNT OPTION #1 **
               IF (OMGPR-P-CNT-LN-BROKER  =  0      OR
                   OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL  =  0)  OR
                  (OMGPR-P-CNT-LN-COST-PLUS  =  0   OR
                   OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL  =  0)
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE ROUNDED =
                           WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ - OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-UNIT-COST
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** YOU CAN NOT HAVE A NEGITIVE REBATE **
                   IF VNG01-F-VEND-NET-CST-RBT  =  'Y'
                       COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE =
                               OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE *
                               (1 - VNG01-P-VEND-NET-CST-RBT)
                   END-IF
      ** YOU CAN NOT HAVE A NEGATIVE REBATE UNLESS VENDOR NEGATIVE
      ** REBATE  SWITCH  IS ACTIVE                 
                   IF OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE  <  ZEROES
NK0616                IF VNG01-F-NEGATIVE-REBATE = 'Y'
NK0616                    CONTINUE
NK0616                ELSE    
NK0616                    MOVE ZEROES    TO OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE
NK0616                END-IF  
                   END-IF
               END-IF
      ** CALCULATE NEGOTIATED SELL REBATE WITH BROKER OPTION #2 **
               IF OMGPR-P-CNT-LN-BROKER     >  0   AND
                  OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL  >  0
      ** COMPUTE VENDOR DISTRIBUTOR REBATE AMOUNT **
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-VND-DIST-REB ROUNDED =
                           OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL -
                           OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-UNIT-COST
      ** COMPUTE CUSTOMER NEGOTIATED SELL/ACQ DIFF **
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-SELL-CST-DIF ROUNDED =
                           WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ -
                           OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL
      ** COMPUTE CONTRACT REBATE AMOUNT **
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE ROUNDED =
                           OMGPR-A-CUR-VND-DIST-REB +
                           OMGPR-A-CUR-SELL-CST-DIF
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** YOU CAN NOT HAVE A NEGATIVE REBATE UNLESS VENDOR NEGATIVE
      ** REBATE  SWITCH  IS ACTIVE
                   IF OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE  <  ZEROES
NK0616                IF VNG01-F-NEGATIVE-REBATE = 'Y'   
NK0616                   CONTINUE 
NK0616                ELSE   
NK0616                   MOVE ZEROES     TO OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE
NK0616                END-IF  
                   END-IF
               END-IF
      ** CALCULATE NEGOTIATED SELL REBATE WITH COST PLUS OPTION #3 **
               IF OMGPR-P-CNT-LN-COST-PLUS  >  0   AND
                  OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL  >  0
      ** COMPUTE VENDOR DISTRIBUTOR REBATE AMOUNT **
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-VND-DIST-REB ROUNDED =
                           OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL -
                           OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-UNIT-COST
      **  COMPUTE CUSTOMER NEGOTIATED SELL/ACQ DIFF **
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-SELL-CST-DIF ROUNDED =
                           WS-REBATE-DEAL-ACQ -
                           OMGPR-A-CNT-LN-SUGG-SELL
      ** COMPUTE CONTRACT REBATE AMOUNT **
                   COMPUTE OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE ROUNDED =
                           OMGPR-A-CUR-VND-DIST-REB +
                           OMGPR-A-CUR-SELL-CST-DIF
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** YOU CAN NOT HAVE A NEGATIVE REBATE UNLESS VENDOR NEGATIVE
      ** REBATE  SWITCH  IS ACTIVE
                   IF OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE  <  ZEROES
NK0616                IF VNG01-F-NEGATIVE-REBATE = 'Y'    
NK0616                   CONTINUE 
NK0616                ELSE   
NK0616                   MOVE ZEROES     TO OMGPR-A-CUR-CONT-REBATE
NK0616                END-IF                                                  
                  END-IF 
                END-IF
      ** CALCULATE PRICE PROTECTION REBATE AMOUNTS OPTION #4 **
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** THE A-CNT-LN-PROT-ACQ FIELD ON THE COST CONTRACT GETS    **
      ** LOADED THE NIGHT BEFORE THE CONTRACT BECOMES EFFECTIVE.  **
      ** ONLY CALCULATE THE PRICE PROTECTION AFTER THE CONTRACT   **
