      ** 10/09/96 - SRC - DATE CHANGE FIX
      ** MOVES TO GET DATES IN THE CORRECT FORMAT FOR COMPARISON.
      ** THIS NEEDED TO BE ADDED DUE TO AN EFFICIENCY RECOMMENDATION
      ** TO REMOVE ADW DATE FORMATS AND EDITING TO MAKE THE PRICER
