                                       TO WS-D-PRICING-COMPARE (5:2)
                   MOVE WS-D-PRICING-HOLD(4:2)
                                       TO WS-D-PRICING-COMPARE (7:2)
                   MOVE OMGPR-D-CNT-PROT-START
