      ** A6Z01-PRO COST DISC MODULE
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** LISTED BELOW ARE THE SEVEN (7) DIFFERENT COST ENTRY METHODS.
      ***
      **   01 = STATED COST - CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-STATED-COST
      ***
      **        - NO EXTRA TABLE TO READ
      ***
      **   02 = SUGGESTED SELL WITH BROKERAGE PERCENT -
      *CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-SS-BROKER-PCT    **
      **        - GET SUGGESTED SELL INFORMATION
      ***
      **   03 = SUGGESTED SELL WITH COST PLUS DISCOUNT -
      *CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-SS-COST-PLUS    **
      **        - GET SUGGESTED SELL INFORMATION
      ***
      **   04 = SUGGESTED SELL WITH STATED COST -
      *CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-SS-STATED-COST         **
      **        - GET SUGGESTED SELL INFORMATION
      ***
      **   05 = SUGGESTED SELL WITH COST DISCOUNT -
      *CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-SS-COST-DISC         **
      **        - GET SUGGESTED SELL INFORMATION
      ***
      **   06 = FIX REBATE AMOUNT - CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-FIXED-REBATE
      ***
      **        - EXTRA INFORMATION NOT NEEDED
      ***
      **   07 = COST DISCOUNT PERCENT FROM PRICE LIST -
      *CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-COST-DISCOUNT    **
      **        - EXTRA INFORMATION NOT NEEDED
      ***
      **   08 = SUGGESTED SELL WITH FIXED REBATE -
      *CCG01-CNT-ENTRY-SS-FIXED              **
      **        - GET SUGGESTED SELL INFORMATION

           EVALUATE CCG01-C-CNT-ENTRY-METHOD
               WHEN '02'
                   MOVE 'Y'            TO WS-F-COST-SUGGESTED-SELL
                   PERFORM 0135-SEL-SUGG-BROKERAG-010  THRU
                           0135-EXIT
                   GO TO 7085-EXIT
               WHEN '03'
                   MOVE 'Y'            TO WS-F-COST-SUGGESTED-SELL
                   PERFORM 0140-SEL-SUGG-COST-PLU-010  THRU
                           0140-EXIT
                   GO TO 7085-EXIT
               WHEN '04'
                   MOVE 'Y'            TO WS-F-COST-SUGGESTED-SELL
                   PERFORM 0145-SEL-SUGG-STATED-010  THRU
                           0145-EXIT
                   GO TO 7085-EXIT
               WHEN '05'
                   MOVE 'Y'            TO WS-F-COST-SUGGESTED-SELL
                   PERFORM 0150-SEL-SUGG-COST-DIS-010  THRU
                           0150-EXIT
                   GO TO 7085-EXIT
               WHEN '08'
                   MOVE 'Y'            TO WS-F-COST-SUGGESTED-SELL
                   PERFORM 0155-SEL-SUGG-FIXED-RE-010  THRU
                           0155-EXIT
               WHEN OTHER
