      ** A6Z01-SEL MAX PRCLST MODULE
      ** 2/13/96 - SRC - ADDED THIS NEW MODULE TO REPLACE A6Z01-SEL MAX
      **                 PRC LST OLD TO IMPROVE EFFICIENCY.
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** 1. USED MAX ON THE EFFECTIVE DATE BECAUSE THE DATES COULD
      **    LAP.  THE EFFECTIVE DATE MUST BE UNIQUE SO WILL GET
      **    ONLY ONE WITH THE HIGHEST EFFECTIVE DATE FOR THE
      **    CURRENT DATE.
      ** 2. USED MAX ON THE PRICE LEVEL TO GET THE HIGHEST NUMBER
      **    TO BE USED AS THE DEFAULT.
      ** 3. USED MAX EFF DATE AND PRICE LEVEL TO SELECT PRICE LIST
      **    ROW TO USE WHEN PRICING.
      ** SELECT MAXIMUM VENDOR PRICE LIST (VNG03) **

           PERFORM 9300-SQL-SELECT-010  THRU
                   9300-EXIT.

           EVALUATE SQLCODE
               WHEN +0
                   PERFORM 9305-SQL-SELECT-010  THRU
                           9305-EXIT
                   EVALUATE SQLCODE
                       WHEN +0
                           PERFORM 9310-SQL-SELECT-010  THRU
                                   9310-EXIT
                           EVALUATE SQLCODE
                               WHEN +0
                                   CONTINUE
                               WHEN +100
                                   MOVE
                                     '#128 - MAX PRICE LIST NOT FOUND'
                                       TO OMGPR-ERROR-MESSAGE
                                   MOVE 128
                                       TO OMGPR-Q-ERROR-NBR
                                   MOVE WS-PRC-LIST-NOT-FOUND-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-Q-ERROR-CODE
                                   MOVE WS-YES-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-F-PRICER-ERROR
                                   GO TO 0020-EXIT-PRICER
                               WHEN OTHER
                                   MOVE 'SELECT'
                                       TO WS-DB-OPERATION
                                   MOVE 'VNG03 MAX'
                                       TO WS-DB-NAME
                                   MOVE SQLCODE
                                       TO WS-DB-RETURN-CODE
                                   MOVE 'DB ERROR'
                                       TO WS-DB-STATUS-MSG
                                   MOVE 129
                                       TO WS-DB-ERROR-NBR
                                          OMGPR-Q-ERROR-NBR
                                   MOVE WS-DB2-FATAL-ERROR-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-Q-ERROR-CODE
                                   MOVE WS-DB-OPERATION-MSG
                                       TO OMGPR-ERROR-MESSAGE
                                   MOVE WS-YES-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-F-PRICER-ERROR
                                   GO TO 0020-EXIT-PRICER
                           END-EVALUATE

                           CONTINUE
                       WHEN +100
                           MOVE '#130 -100 MAX PRICE LIST NOT FOUND'
                                       TO OMGPR-ERROR-MESSAGE
                           MOVE 130    TO OMGPR-Q-ERROR-NBR
                           MOVE WS-PRC-LIST-NOT-FOUND-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-Q-ERROR-CODE
                           MOVE WS-YES-IND
                                       TO OMGPR-F-PRICER-ERROR
                           GO TO 0020-EXIT-PRICER
