       7715-PRO-ROUNDING-010.

      * A6Z01-PRO ROUNDING MODULE
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** THIS MODULE IS USED TO ROUND THE FINAL SELL PRICE.  IT
      ** CURRENTLY USES THREE DIFFERENT ROUNDING METHODS:
      ** 1. NO ROUNDING TO FOUR DIGITS.
      ** 2. ROUND UP TO TWO DIGITS.
      ** 3. NORMAL ROUNDING TO TWO DIGITS.
      **
      ** THE FIELDS WITH A SUFFIX "UN" ARE THE UNROUNDED VALUES.

           MOVE OMGPR-A-CUS-UOM-SELL-PRC
                                       TO OMGPR-A-CUS-UOM-SELL-PRC-UN.
           MOVE OMGPR-A-TOTAL-SELL     TO OMGPR-A-TOTAL-SELL-UN.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN WS-NO-ROUNDING
                   GO TO 7715-EXIT
               WHEN WS-UP-TWO-ROUNDING
                   COMPUTE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND ROUNDED = 0.0049 +
                           OMGPR-A-CUS-UOM-SELL-PRC
                   MOVE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND
                                       TO OMGPR-A-CUS-UOM-SELL-PRC
                   COMPUTE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND ROUNDED = 0.0049 +
                           OMGPR-A-TOTAL-SELL
                   MOVE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND
                                       TO OMGPR-A-TOTAL-SELL
               WHEN WS-NORMAL-TWO-ROUNDING
                   COMPUTE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND ROUNDED = 1.0 *
                           OMGPR-A-CUS-UOM-SELL-PRC
                   MOVE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND
                                       TO OMGPR-A-CUS-UOM-SELL-PRC
                   COMPUTE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND ROUNDED = 1.0 *
                           OMGPR-A-TOTAL-SELL
                   MOVE WS-A-UNIT-PRICE-ROUND
                                       TO OMGPR-A-TOTAL-SELL
               WHEN OTHER
                   GO TO 7715-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

      * END OF: A6Z01-PRO ROUNDING MODULE

