       7720-PRO-EXPIRE-DATES-010.

      ** A6Z01-PRO EXPIRE DATES MODULE
      ** COMMENTS: **
      ** THIS MODULE WILL PROCESS THE EXPIRATION DATES OF THE DATA THAT
      ** WAS USED TO CALCULATE THE PRICE FOR AN ITEM.  THE FIRST
      *EXPIRATION
      ** DATE THAT WILL BE REACHED IS PASSED BACK TO THE DRIVER PROGRAM.
      ** THIS DATE WILL GIVE THE USER A GOOD INDICATION OF WHEN THE
      *PRICE
      ** THAT WAS CALCULATED COULD EXPIRE.

           IF WS-Q-CHECK  =  ZEROES
      ** ALL EXPIRATION DATES ARE NULL VALUES **
               MOVE SPACES             TO OMGPR-D-EXPIRATION
               GO TO 7720-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE 1                      TO WS-SUB1.
      ** MOVE THE FIRST EXPIRE DATE TO THE HOLD AREA **
           MOVE WS-ALL-NINES           TO WS-D-CHECK-HOLD.
      *    MOVE WS-D-CHECK (WS-SUB1)   TO WS-D-CHECK-HOLD.

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-SUB1  >  WS-Q-CHECK   OR
                         WS-SUB1  >  WS-Q-CHECK-MAX
               IF WS-D-CHECK (WS-SUB1)  >  SPACES
                   IF WS-D-CHECK (WS-SUB1)  NOT =  WS-D-CHECK-HOLD
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK (WS-SUB1)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-MOVE
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK-MOVE(7:4)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-COMPARE(1:4)
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK-MOVE(1:2)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-COMPARE(5:2)
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK-MOVE(4:2)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-COMPARE(7:2)
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK-HOLD(7:4)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-HOLD-COMPARE(1:4)
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK-HOLD(1:2)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-HOLD-COMPARE(5:2)
                       MOVE WS-D-CHECK-HOLD(4:2)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-HOLD-COMPARE(7:2)
                       IF WS-D-CHECK-COMPARE  <  WS-D-CHECK-HOLD-COMPARE
                           MOVE WS-D-CHECK (WS-SUB1)
                                       TO WS-D-CHECK-HOLD
                       END-IF
                   END-IF
               END-IF
               ADD 1                   TO WS-SUB1
           END-PERFORM.

NK0615     IF WS-D-CHECK-HOLD =  WS-ALL-NINES
NK0615         CONTINUE
NK0615     ELSE
NK0615         MOVE WS-D-CHECK-HOLD        TO OMGPR-D-EXPIRATION
NK0615     END-IF.

